561
00:23:01,760 --> 00:23:06,000
I realized that it is very easy for me,

562
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:06,920
probably just me,

563
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:07,480
only me,

564
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:07,880
I'm sure,

565
00:23:07,880 --> 00:23:12,380
to become distracted

566
00:23:12,380 --> 00:23:17,400
